{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n76.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"92","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"A psalm, a song for the Sabbath day: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"It is good to thank the Lord and to sing praise to Thy Name, O Most High, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"to proclaim Thy kindness in the morning and Thy faithfulness at night, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"on the ten-stringed harp, through meditation on the zither. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For Thou hast gladdened me, O Lord, with Thy deeds, in the works of Thy hands do I exult. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"How great are Thy works, O Lord, profound indeed are Thy thoughts. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"A simpleton cannot know, nor can a fool understand this, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"when the wicked flourish like grass and all evil-doers blossom forth only to be destroyed for ever. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"But Thou art supreme to eternity, O Lord. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Behold Thine enemies, O Lord, behold Thine enemies shall perish, all evil-doers shall scatter. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Then shalt Thou lift up my horn like the unicorn, I am anointed with fresh oil. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Then shall my eye look down upon my adversaries, when evil men rise up against me my ears shall hear. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The righteous shall flourish like the palm, like the cedar on Lebanon shall he grow. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Those planted in the House of the Lord shall blossom forth in the courts of our God. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"They will yet be luxuriant in old age, full of sap and fresh will they be, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/92/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"so as to proclaim that the Lord is upright, my Rock in whom there is no wrong. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
